{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55122","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经险路，惟是（京本作「则」、辛本、川本作「爲则」）忌天罡。\n加孟前行喜（辛本、川本、京本作「应」）不喜，罡临四仲己中伤，加季後（京本作「复」）逃亡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}